Z||000000||Phantom Rage||06-04-2001||03:54 PM||||I have no clue as to where this little guy goes.  It is from the Prothane front end bushing kit.  There are four of them in total.  This is intended for installation on an 88 coupe.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/bushing.jpg"> <P>As always thank you <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>||||reg||5
Z||000001||c m west||06-04-2001||04:41 PM||||it is a thrust bearing bushing intended for 84-87 models, not used on yours - so to answer your question it goes straight in the trash.<P>Eric  West Coast Fiero <A HREF="http://www.cwestco.com" TARGET=_blank>www.cwestco.com</A> <BR>310-305-4111||||reg||1
