Z||000003||DRH||06-04-2001||05:41 PM||||Hmmm... I used them on my 88 Formula. Should be the same as the coupe. I put them over the small end of the lower control arm bushing after I put it in the control arm and  before I put it in the frame (if that makes any sense. Seems like it serves the same purpose as it would on the pre-88s, although I have never looked at a pre-88 that close.<BR>||||reg||5
